    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καπρ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the ovary of sows</i>, cut out to
			prevent their breeding, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				632a21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>virus in sows</i>, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππομανές</span>
			 in mares, ib.<i><span class="en">
				572a21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				573b2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>dance in armour</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάππαρις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.173
			</span></i>.</div>
